{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1791357960659,"sessionID":"ses_eeac95a08ffePV4Q3pT4u1pnwg","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"read","callID":"zvHHLbRwiLLHomDU","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/user/auto-psych/data/rsa/loop_smoke2_repair/round_1/candidate_2/hypothesis.md"},"output":"<path>/home/user/auto-psych/data/rsa/loop_smoke2_repair/round_1/candidate_2/hypothesis.md</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>\n1: Listeners reason at depth 2 by inverting a speaker who anticipates a depth-1 pragmatic listener, combining recursive pragmatic reasoning with a salience prior over referents. The salience prior, shaped by visual feature complexity and familiarization base rates, enters only the pragmatic listener's top-level inference and is not simulated in lower-level agents.\n\n(End of file - total 1 lines)\n</content>","metadata":{"preview":"Listeners reason at depth 2 by inverting a speaker who anticipates a depth-1 pragmatic listener, combining recursive pragmatic reasoning with a salience prior over referents. The salience prior, shaped by visual feature complexity and familiarization base rates, enters only the pragmatic listener's top-level inference and is not simulated in lower-level agents.","truncated":false,"loaded":[],"display":{"type":"file","path":"/home/user/auto-psych/data/rsa/loop_smoke2_repair/round_1/candidate_2/hypothesis.md","text":"Listeners reason at depth 2 by inverting a speaker who anticipates a depth-1 pragmatic listener, combining recursive pragmatic reasoning with a salience prior over referents. The salience prior, shaped by visual feature complexity and familiarization base rates, enters only the pragmatic listener's top-level inference and is not simulated in lower-level agents.","lineStart":1,"lineEnd":1,"totalLines":1,"truncated":false}},"title":"data/rsa/loop_smoke2_repair/round_1/candidate_2/hypothesis.md","time":{"start":1791357960598,"end":1791357960623}},"metadata":{"google":{"thoughtSignature":"EpYBCpMBAWkUfRPqr0RDvm